4872+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["**Volatility.** Daily volatility is the standard deviation of daily returns. Annualised volatility scales it by the square root of 252 trading days, the usual convention for comparing volatility across time horizons. The same 252 day convention is applied to every asset so the figures are comparable. Cryptocurrencies trade every day, so their annualised figures are conservative."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":21,"id":"b270b5b3","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-22T17:50:02.923936Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-22T17:50:02.923602Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-22T17:50:02.938399Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-22T17:50:02.937568Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.033666,"end_time":"2026-10-22T17:50:02.940197+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-22T17:50:02.906531+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>daily_volatility</th>\n","      <th>annual_volatility</th>\n","      <th>asset_class</th>\n","    </tr>\n","  </thead>\n","  <tbody>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>SOL-USD</th>\n","      <td>4.856360</td>\n","      <td>77.092331</td>\n","      <td>crypto</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>ETH-USD</th>\n","      <td>3.589356</td>\n","      <td>56.979257</td>\n","      <td>crypto</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>BTC-USD</th>\n","      <td>2.662165</td>\n","      <td>42.260561</td>\n","      <td>crypto</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>AAPL</th>\n","      <td>1.765306</td>\n","      <td>28.023367</td>\